s no explicit connection provided linking Kim Un-yong's membership in a specific group directly to *the* president mentioned in a single document snippet without further context (like a date), I must try to narrow down which group is intended. However, given the presence of both IOC and WTF memberships, and the detailed presidential history of the IOC, focusing on the IOC seems the most promising path, but it requires more specificity.\nGiven that Kim Un-yong was listed as a 'vice-president of the International Olympic Committee' (Passage 6), I should check if any retrieved document connects him to a specific time frame when one of the listed presidents held office."}
