resident is listed last as being in power/elected. José Ramos-Horta was elected in May 2022.\n\nI have identified East Timor as the 'new country' and found that José Ramos-Horta is the president based on the provided text detailing his election.", "finding": "Satyo Husodo's birth country is Indonesia (Passage 5). The Commission on Truth and Friendship was established jointly by Indonesia and East Timor (Passage 2). East Timor became a sovereign state (a 'new country') on May 20, 2002 (Passage 4).\nSeveral presidents of East Timor are mentioned: Xanana Gusmão (first president), José Ramos-Horta (elected in May 2017 and again on May 20, 2022 against Francisco Guterres), and Francisco Guterres (elected in May 2017) (Passage 3).", "answer": "José Ramos-Horta", "next_query": null}
