"finding": "Humphrey Bogart was in Crime School (Passage 6). Humphrey Bogart won the Academy Award for Best Actor for his portrayal of a cantankerous river steam launch skipper opposite Katharine Hepburn in The African Queen (1951), which is stated as his only award of three nominations (Passage 3).",
